<div class="about">
    <div class="about__header">
        <h6>We provide the best services. Need help?</h6>
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p>Trust, Integrity, Punctuality, Quality, to be Open, to be Kind, to be Role Model</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about__content">
       <div class="row">
           <div class="desktop-6 phone-12 tab-port-12">
                <div class="about_text">
                    <h5>We are increasing bussiness success with the technology</h5>
                        <p>ECOHYGIENE COMPANY LTD was founded in 2015 in Tanzania by Tanzanian entrepreneurs. The company began as a supplier of laboratory equipment, chemicals, consumables,
                         personal protective equipment, and maintenance services for the items supplied..</p>
                        
                         <p>
                      By 2017, ECOHYGIENE COMPANY LIMITED expanded its operations to include the sale of raw materials such as caustic soda flakes, sodium hypochlorite, and common salts to leading food industry companies, including CCK, Bakheresa Food Products, Super Meal Food, Sayona Food Products, Jambo Food Products Limited, ASAS Products Limited, and Mega Beverage Limited.
                        </p>

                        <p>In 2023, the company relocated its operations to Mkuranga district – Pwani Region, where it established its own blending and mixing plant, having previously operated in the SIDO Industrial Area – Vingunguti. Today, ECOHYGIENE COMPANY LIMITED manufactures and supplies a wide range of products under its brand name, including CIP, COP, conveyor lubricants, utility chemicals, WSP, WTP, and other specialized solutions. In addition, the company provides professional services to customers who choose to use its products.</p>

                        <p>
                        To meet customer needs and ensure the highest standards, ECOHYGIENE COMPANY LIMITED is certified under ISO 9001:2015 (Quality Management System) and ISO 22000:2018 (Food Safety System). The company has also fulfilled national regulatory requirements and is recognized by government institutions and authorities such as TBS, GLCA, and OSHA.


                        </p>

<p>
ECOHYGIENE COMPANY LIMITED is essential to its customers by delivering superior products and services that help them achieve their goals. Our unique approach to sourcing and supplying ensures the highest quality and best value, providing exactly what you need, precisely when and where you need it.

We are committed to continuously building our company through the dedication of our team, guided by the values of innovation, integrity, reliability, service, and teamwork.

</p>

                </div>
           </div>
            <div class="desktop-6 phone-12 tab-port-6">
                <div class="about_images">
                    <% @hero_images.each do |hero_image| %>
                        <% images = hero_image.images.limit(1) %>
                        <% images.each do |image| %>
                            <%= image_tag image, class: "about__img" %>
                        <% end %>
                    <% end %>
                </div>
            </div>
       </div>
    </div>

</div>